<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 192-6 DEC AND 213-1, LEEWARDS 148 - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 192-6 DEC AND 213-1, LEEWARDS 148 - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, 44 ahead on first innings, were 213-1 at the close on the second day of their three-day match against the Leeward Islands on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 192-6 dec and 213-1 (R.Arnold 104 not out, M.Atapattu 90 not out). Leeward Islands 148 (M.Muralitharan 4-34).</p>
